// The device's control points in alias order: GALAXY_ALIASES[n] is
// the path whose device alias is @n, with its verbatim human-readable
// name (identical `name`/`description` describe fields; leading spaces
// are the device's own formatting) and the live-dump default. A null
// default marks curated LIVE_DRIFT (operator/venue state on the
// in-use unit): the guide default in the template table stands.
struct GalaxyAliasEntry
